; TORRE HUNDIDA - full-screen decoration + title logo (ui-designer). Used only by the
; LCD-off screens (TITLE, GAMEOVER, CLEAR). vram_order: ["ui", "font", "walls", "uiscreens"]
; -> it sits in the free BG margin after the walls (gdd 7.1: 232-255, 24 tiles). 24 tiles.
; Consecutive runs (append only): LOGO_00..LOGO_15.

; ---------------- earth (the tower is underground): ceiling band of the screens
; earth fill, seamless (row 0 of TITLE / GAMEOVER / CLEAR)
@ EARTH
++++-+++
+#++++++
+++++#++
++-+++++
+++++++#
+#+++-++
+++#++++
-+++++#+
; lower edge of the earth with hanging roots (row 1), variant A
@ EARTH_EDGE_A
++++-+++
+#++++#+
#++++++#
.##++##.
...##...
...#....
..#.....
..#.....
; variant B (alternate A/B along the row to break the 8 px repeat)
@ EARTH_EDGE_B
+++#++++
++++++-+
#++++++#
.#+++##.
..##....
...#....
...#....
....#...

; ---------------- the tower, upside down: wall bricks and battlements hanging DOWN
